      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bilidadi wakuShuhi hakumwakula nindi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku aŋahi imukutila mazu nyihetu? Neyi munatonojoki dehi chachiwahi etu twakahosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulonanyi munatufuukuli nenu tuyanyama? Munatumoni ŋahi nenu tudi amajilu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wuditabolaŋa nakuzuwa kweyi; hamujimba weyi komana iseki dakashala kanka wadu? Indi ilola dakatutuluka mudekala?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala chimunyi chawatama akachima, muzuzu wahejiku dindi hiwakatoŋekaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimunyi chamwitenti dindi chakeyila bwi-i, inoŋu dahewulu dindi dakeyila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yintampu yaŋovu jindi yakashika hashintakana, mpùŋa yindi yomweni yoyakamudimbwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadumbili muwanda nanyendu yindi yomweni, wadiŋaŋa mumuhetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chidiya chakamukwatila kukapokosu, wakafwa mumuhetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anamutili mwonji hamaseki, anamutili muhetu munjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakafwa mutentu wakumutiyisha woma mbadi jejima, mutentu owu wakamukupisha chakumunuŋa kutupokosu twindi kachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋovu jindi jinafwomoki nanzala, kukala kwakamonayi kwakamwimena kwakwihi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwakadya yidi yamujimba windi, mwalala wedi wakufwa wakadya yidi yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamukoka mwitenti danakuhweleliyi; akamushikŋa kudi mwanta wafwishaŋa mutentu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitenti dindi mwakashakama acheŋi, hiayinduku; hindi hashakamayi akamwaŋilahu kesi kaNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiji yindi yakoma mwishina chau, mutayi windi hewulu akawuketulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakamwanuka cheŋi hamasekuku, hanzi hihakekala cheŋi ijina dinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamutemuna muchejeji, akamutwala mumwidima, akamufumisha munu mwishina chakumukupisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakekala namwana hela namwizukulu hakachi kawantaŋa jinduku, kwashakaminiyi hikwakashala hoku muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashakama kumujika akahayama yihuŋu yamweniyi, ashakama kumusela akakwata chikasa kukanwa nawoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala dimu mwashakamawu áheŋa, dihu hekala wabula kwiluka Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
